  "id": "locomotor-ataxia",
  "term": "locomotor ataxia",
  "definition": "In this packet, locomotor ataxia refers to a congenital disorder in lambs linked to copper deficiency during the second half of the ewe’s pregnancy. It involves worsening lack of coordination in the hind limbs and abnormal development of neurons and myelin in the central nervous system.",
